{"id":11238,"date":"2023-01-09T12:05:30","date_gmt":"2023-01-09T12:05:30","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/seminar-perspectives-of-analysis-of-new-materials-and-energy-sources\/"},"modified":"2023-01-09T12:05:30","modified_gmt":"2023-01-09T12:05:30","slug":"seminar-perspectives-of-analysis-of-new-materials-and-energy-sources","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/seminar-perspectives-of-analysis-of-new-materials-and-energy-sources\/","title":{"rendered":"Seminar: Perspectives of analysis of new materials and energy sources"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>Dear customers!<\/p>\n<p>Together with the <a href=\"https:\/\/www.fmt.vsb.cz\/cs\/studium\/?gclid=Cj0KCQjw7KqZBhCBARIsAI-fTKLWX5v4GwsU-oeWYSoU_90oNY8vCae2oAAEHZvNckSmStqNDOD9U84aAo0vEALw_wcB\"><strong>Technical University of Ostrava<\/strong><\/a> and <a href=\"https:\/\/www.pragolab.cz\/\"><strong>Pragolab<\/strong><\/a> company, we would like to invite you to the seminar Perspectives on the Analysis of New Materials and Energy Sources. It takes place on <strong>October 25 from 9:00 a.m. to 2:00 p.m.<\/strong> in hall A2 at V\u0160B-TU in Ostrava. The capacity of the seminar is limited, so if you want to participate, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.pragolab.cz\/workshop-perspektivy-analyzy-novych-materialu-a-zdroju-energie\"><strong>you must register<\/strong><\/a>.<\/p>\n<p>You can look forward to the following lectures:<\/p>\n<ul>\n<li>Tools for research and characterization of cells, batteries and redox properties of substances<\/li>\n<li>XPS\/ESCA spectroscopy application<\/li>\n<li>Characterization of materials using thermal analysis, physisorption and chemisorption<\/li>\n<li>Size of (nano)particles and stability of concentrated dispersions including description of solidification of thin layers<\/li>\n<li>The use of sonicators in the preparation of nanoparticles both in laboratory and industrial practice<\/li>\n<li>Materialography, namely sample preparation, microscopy and mechanical properties<\/li>\n<li>Infrared spectroscopy and microscopy of composite polymer materials<\/li>\n<li>News in Infrared Gas Spectroscopy: Examples of Modern Applications Focusing on Alternative Motor Vehicle Drives<\/li>\n<li>The use of Raman and IR-SNOM microscopy in the improvement process of Li-ion batteries<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Dear customers! Together with the Technical University of Ostrava and Pragolab company, we would like to invite you to the seminar Perspectives on the Analysis of New Materials and Energy Sources. It takes place on October 25 from 9:00 a.m. to 2:00 p.m. in hall A2 at V\u0160B-TU in Ostrava. The capacity of the seminar [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":2,"featured_media":10996,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"footnotes":""},"categories":[109,33],"tags":[],"class_list":["post-11238","post","type-post","status-publish","format-standard","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","category-109","category-news"],"yoast_head":"<!-- This site is optimized with the Yoast SEO plugin v26.8 - https:\/\/yoast.com\/product\/yoast-seo-wordpress\/ -->\n<title>Seminar: Perspectives of analysis of new materials and energy sources - NicoletCZ<\/title>\n<meta name=\"robots\" content=\"index, follow, max-snippet:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-video-preview:-1\" \/>\n<link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https:\/\/nicoletcz.cz\/en\/seminar-perspectives-of-analysis-of-new-materials-and-energy-sources\/\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:locale\" content=\"en_US\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"Seminar: Perspectives of analysis of new materials and energy sources - NicoletCZ\" \/>\n<meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"Dear customers! Together with the Technical University of Ostrava and Pragolab company, we would like to invite you to the seminar Perspectives on the Analy